    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST HOLY SHOT</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040180/extras/67dd408745527344dd13dff71f5e8d8d.avif?t=1755469196\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blessed are those who pull the trigger and don\u2019t let go until the magazine\u2019s empty! Get ready for a frenetic top-down action experience. Battle relentless hordes of demons and tough-as-nails bosses in a world of chaotic destruction, armed with the most powerful and blessed weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040180/extras/c8d8dd401883ce4f4a4fb3e5b413e02b.poster.avif?t=1755469196\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040180/extras/c8d8dd401883ce4f4a4fb3e5b413e02b.webm?t=1755469196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040180/extras/c8d8dd401883ce4f4a4fb3e5b413e02b.mp4?t=1755469196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Highlights</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Gameplay:</strong> Destroy the environment around you, blow up entire mountains, and unleash firestorms upon floods of arachnids!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategy &amp; Progression:</strong> Know your enemies and arsenal, create effective strategies, and push further each time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Battles:</strong> Study and defeat unique, challenging bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Arsenal:</strong> Set up turrets and explosives, use several weapon types, find the best power-up combinations, <br>and escape massive hordes with nuclear blasts and holy rains.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Visual Style:</strong> Uncover secrets and explore a world filled with angelic and demonic imagery, featuring grotesque and bizarre monsters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040180/extras/8e3df0735198c577e7dafc4a2a3aee90.poster.avif?t=1755469196\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040180/extras/8e3df0735198c577e7dafc4a2a3aee90.webm?t=1755469196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040180/extras/8e3df0735198c577e7dafc4a2a3aee90.mp4?t=1755469196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040180/extras/591b59072bd7b6cae4a25f89f3c24af2.poster.avif?t=1755469196\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040180/extras/591b59072bd7b6cae4a25f89f3c24af2.webm?t=1755469196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040180/extras/591b59072bd7b6cae4a25f89f3c24af2.mp4?t=1755469196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040180/extras/4a112ea3d50c4500981ecc48ba58aa78.poster.avif?t=1755469196\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040180/extras/4a112ea3d50c4500981ecc48ba58aa78.webm?t=1755469196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040180/extras/4a112ea3d50c4500981ecc48ba58aa78.mp4?t=1755469196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blessed are those who pull the trigger and don\u2019t let go until the magazine\u2019s empty! Get ready for a frenetic top-down action experience. Battle relentless hordes of demons and tough-as-nails bosses in a world of chaotic destruction, armed with the most powerful and blessed weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040180/extras/c8d8dd401883ce4f4a4fb3e5b413e02b.poster.avif?t=1755469196\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040180/extras/c8d8dd401883ce4f4a4fb3e5b413e02b.webm?t=1755469196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040180/extras/c8d8dd401883ce4f4a4fb3e5b413e02b.mp4?t=1755469196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Highlights</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Gameplay:</strong> Destroy the environment around you, blow up entire mountains, and unleash firestorms upon floods of arachnids!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategy &amp; Progression:</strong> Know your enemies and arsenal, create effective strategies, and push further each time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Battles:</strong> Study and defeat unique, challenging bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Arsenal:</strong> Set up turrets and explosives, use several weapon types, find the best power-up combinations, <br>and escape massive hordes with nuclear blasts and holy rains.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Visual Style:</strong> Uncover secrets and explore a world filled with angelic and demonic imagery, featuring grotesque and bizarre monsters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040180/extras/8e3df0735198c577e7dafc4a2a3aee90.poster.avif?t=1755469196\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040180/extras/8e3df0735198c577e7dafc4a2a3aee90.webm?t=1755469196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040180/extras/8e3df0735198c577e7dafc4a2a3aee90.mp4?t=1755469196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040180/extras/591b59072bd7b6cae4a25f89f3c24af2.poster.avif?t=1755469196\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040180/extras/591b59072bd7b6cae4a25f89f3c24af2.webm?t=1755469196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040180/extras/591b59072bd7b6cae4a25f89f3c24af2.mp4?t=1755469196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040180/extras/4a112ea3d50c4500981ecc48ba58aa78.poster.avif?t=1755469196\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040180/extras/4a112ea3d50c4500981ecc48ba58aa78.webm?t=1755469196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040180/extras/4a112ea3d50c4500981ecc48ba58aa78.mp4?t=1755469196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
